flowchart LR
  API[ApiHost composition root] --> P[Logging → Validation → Transaction]
  P --> C[ICommand Response, Owner]
  C --> H[Module Application Handler]
  H --> U[Module UnitOfWork port]
  P --> X[Keyed module Transaction Executor]
  X --> DB[Module DbContext]
  X --> TP[ITransactionParticipant]
  TP --> O[Module Outbox or Inbox record]
  DB --> SQL[(Module local database)]
  O --> SQL
